h1 class="text-center display-3 text-shadow" style="color: #000;"> Mechanical Engineering Student </h1> <p class="fs-5 mb-2" style="color: rgb(34, 36, 38);"> Design • Analysis • Manufacturing • AI-Enhanced Engineering </p> </div> </div> <section class="container text-center"> <h3 style="color: #000;"> MECHANICAL ENGINEERING STUDENT AT THE OHIO STATE UNIVERSITY </h3> <hr/> <h5 style="color: rgb(34, 36, 38);"> Mechanical Engineering Student with experience in product design, numerical modeling, manufacturing, engineering testing, technical communication, and AI-driven workflow optimization. </h5> </section> <div class="row mt-4"> <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" href="#"> View Projects </button> <button type="button" class="btn btn-success" href="#"> Download Resume </button> <a href="#" style="color: rgb(34, 36, 38);"> Connect on LinkedIn </a> </div> <section id="stats"> <div class="container-fluid p-0"> <div class="row align-items-center text-center justify-content-center" style="background-color: #000; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> <div class="col-1 p-2"> <i class="fa fa-gear fa-3x m-auto" role="presentation"> </i> </div> <span class="fs-5 mt-4"> Mechanical Engineering Student </span> <br/> <span class="fs-5"> Mechanical Engineering Intern </span> <br/> <span class="fs-5"> Undergraduate Teaching Assistant </span> <br/> <span class="fs-5"> Dean’s List Recipient </span> </div> <p class="text-center fs-4 text-light" style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> From concept to production. </p> </div> </section> </section> <main id="about"> <h2 class="display-3 fw-bold" style="color: #000;"> About Me </h2> <hr/> <p class="text-justify" style="color: rgb(34, 36, 38);"> As a Mechanical Engineering student at The Ohio State University, I have gained experience in various areas of engineering, including product design, numerical modeling, manufacturing, engineering testing, technical communication, and AI-driven workflow optimization. </p> <h3 class="display-4" style="color: #000;"> How I Work </h3> <hr/> <p class="text-justify fw-bold" style="color: rgb(34, 36, 38);"> I combine engineering design, manufacturing, and AI tools to create better products. This approach involves understanding market research, identifying performance goals, designing with manufacturability in mind, creating detailed engineering drawings, communicating effectively, and optimizing workflows through automation. </p> </main> <section id="projects"> <h2 class="display-3 fw-bold" style="color: #000;"> Featured Engineering Project </h2> <hr/> <div class="row p-0 m-0 g-4 align-items-stretch" style="background-color: rgb(243, 245, 247);"> <article class="col-md-5 col-lg-4 offset-lg-1" style="text-align: center; background-color: #fff;"> <a href="#"> <h3> Zero Torque Golf Putter </h3> </a> <img alt="" src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/josephkozlowski/josephkozlowski.github.io@main/assets/images/projects/ztorque-golf-putter/0.png" width="100%"/> <hr/> <p class="fs-5" style="color: #000;"> From Market Research to CNC Machined Product </p> </article> <div class="col-md-7 col-lg-6 p-2"> <div class="row"> <h4> THE PROBLEM </h4> <p style="color: rgb(34, 36, 38);"> Traditional putters suffer from face rotation and inconsistent alignment. </p> <br/> <h4> MARKET RESEARCH </h4> <img alt="" src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/josephkozlowski/josephkozlowski.github.io@main/assets/images/projects/ztorque-golf-putter/market.png" width="100%"/> </div> <hr/> <article class="row p-0 m-0 g-4 align-items-stretch"> <h4> ENGINEERING REQUIREMENTS </h4> <img alt="" src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/josephkozlowski/josephkozlowski.github.io@main/assets/images/projects/ztorque-golf-putter/spec.png" width="100%"/> </article> <hr/> <div class="row"> <h4> CAD DEVELOPMENT </h4> <p style="color: rgb(34, 36, 38);"> SolidWorks and Onshape were used to create a design that achieved the desired balance, manufacturability, and performance. </p> <br/> <img alt="" src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/josephkozlowski/josephkozlowski.github.io@main/assets/images/projects/ztorque-golf-putter/design.png" width="100%"/> </div> <hr/> <article class="row p-0 m-0 g-4 align-items-stretch"> <h4> DESIGN FOR MANUFACTURING </h4> <img alt="" src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/josephkozlowski/josephkozlowski.github.io@main/assets/images/projects/ztorque-golf-putter/manufacturing.png" width="100%"/> </article> <hr/> <p class="fs-5 mb-0 mt-auto" style="color: rgb(34, 36, 38);"> <a href="#"> View Case Study </a> </p> </div> </div> <section id="projects"> <h2 class="display-3 fw-bold" style="color: #000;"> Other Projects </h2> <hr/> <article class="row p-0 m-0 g-4 align-items-stretch mb-5" style="background-color: rgb(243, 245, 247);"> <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4"> <a href="#"> <h3> Numerical Modeling of a Vibration Isolation System </h3> </a> <img alt="" src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/josephkozlowski/josephkozlowski.github.io@main/assets/images/projects/nnumerical-modeling-of-a-vibration-isolation-system/0.png" width="100%"/> <hr/> <p class="fs-5" style="color: #000;"> MATLAB Analysis <br/> Numerical Differentiation <br/> Curve Fitting <br/> Model Selection <br/> Engineering Conclusions </p> </div> <hr/> </article> </section> </main> <footer id="contact"> <h2 class="display-3 fw-bold" style="color: #000;"> Connect with Me </h2> <hr/> <p class="fs-5 text-center" style="color: rgb(34, 36, 38);"> Contact me for any inquiries or collaborations. </p> <div class="row p-0 m-0 g-4 align-items-stretch" style="background-color: #000; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding-bottom: 1rem;"> <article class="col-md-6 col-lg-4"> <h4> Email </h4> <p class="fs-5 mb-0" style="color: rgb(34, 36, 38);"> <a href="mailto:josephkozlowski.109@osu.edu"> josephkozlowski.109@osu.edu </a> </p> <hr/> </article> <article class="col-md-6 col-lg-4"> <h4> LinkedIn </h4> <p class="fs-5 mb-0" style="color: rgb(34, 36, 38);"> <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/joseph-kozlowski-8255dfs0093636312"> https://www.linkedin.com/in/joseph-kozlowski-8255dfs0093636312 </a> </p> <hr/> </article> <article class="col-md-6 col-lg-4"> <h4> Location </h4> <p class="fs-5 mb-0" style="color: rgb(34, 36, 38);"> Columbus, Ohio </p> <hr/> </article> </div> <p class="text-center fs-5 mt-auto" style="color: rgb(34, 36, 38);"> Copyright &copy; Joseph Kozlowski | 2023 </p> </footer> </body> </html>
